# The downloaded spec snapshot in provider-dev/downloaded/ and the split
# source in provider-dev/source/ ARE committed: the spec is served
# unversioned, and committing the snapshot makes every refresh a reviewable
# diff against the hash pin in provider-dev/config/spec_pin.json.
